ONEDRAFT
CAD-AI — Aria Powered
Executable Repository Foundation & Core Application Runtime
Version 1.0
Status: Implementation Specification
Predecessor: OneDraft Database Schema & OpenAPI Contract v0.1
Architecture Layer: Executable Foundation
Database: PostgreSQL
API: FastAPI / REST / JSON
API Version: /api/v1
Domain Language: Python
Validation Models: Pydantic
Identifiers: UUID
AI Layer: Aria Powered
Runtime Model: API + Worker + PostgreSQL + Redis
Primary Objective: Convert the established OneDraft architecture into an executable repository foundation.

1. IMPLEMENTATION POSITION
The OneDraft architecture has now passed through:
Product Definition
System Architecture
Technology Architecture
Domain Model
Persistence Model
OpenAPI Contract
Versioning Model
AI Command Boundary
Regulatory Model
Drawing Model
Redline Model
Validation Model
Document Provenance
Acceptance Workflow
Application Stack
The system now enters the executable repository stage.
The purpose of this stage is not to redesign OneDraft.
The purpose is to create the first functioning software skeleton capable of executing the previously established architecture.
The repository therefore becomes the first physical implementation of the OneDraft computational model.

