The API shall never maintain one global mutable transaction for the lifetime of the process.
The worker shall independently acquire database sessions.
Transactions shall be explicitly bounded.
Conceptually:
REQUEST
 ↓
SESSION
 ↓
TRANSACTION
 ↓
DOMAIN OPERATION
 ↓
COMMIT / ROLLBACK
 ↓
SESSION CLOSE

